<title>FINLAND: Valmet jumps on Partek-Sisu merger news.</title>
<headline>Valmet jumps on Partek-Sisu merger news.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy rose sharply on Wednesday on news of a merger between Partek Oy Ab and  Sisu Oy, which Valmet said would give it an extraordinary gain of 200 million markka.</p>
<p>At 1515/1315 GMT Valmet traded at 82.0 markka, up 3.50 markka or up almost five percent, in active volume.</p>
<p>Valmet said it would get a 10.5 percent stake in the new merged Partek, and would book extroardinary gains of almost 200 million markka by exchanging its Sisu shares for Partek shares.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +35-9680 50 235</p>
